  "message_id": "SEL_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}怎么了？{F5 47 02 01 02 01 09 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_272.bf.json:2:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}别担心{F5 47 02 01 02 01 01 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_272.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 B7 0D}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}我在看时钟塔。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_272.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 B7 0D}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}我没有担心什么。\n只是看着那座时钟塔。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_272.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}你们来到这里之前，\n我从来没在意过那座时钟塔。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_272.bf.json:5:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}明明它就矗立在那么显眼的地方……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_272.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0052",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 07 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 A1 0D}把你们卷入这场“命运”的元凶，\n就在那座时钟塔里……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_272.bf.json:6:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_0052",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}也在你眼前……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_272.bf.json:6:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_0052",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}把你们牵扯进来，真的很抱歉。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_272.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}别在意{F5 47 02 01 02 01 07 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_272.bf.json:7:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}倒是玩得很开心{F5 47 02 01 02 01 07 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_272.bf.json:7:2",
  "message_id": "SEL_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}可不想再来第二次{F5 47 02 01 02 01 01 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_272.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 13 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 B7 0D}{F1 82}……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_272.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0072",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}我一直觉得不可思议，\n为什么你和大家\n能够如此宽容。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_272.bf.json:9:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_0072",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}现在，我知道答案了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_272.bf.json:9:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_0072",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}因为你们有“心意”。\n也可以称为意志或志向。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_272.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 13 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 B3 11}应该不会再有第二次了……\n因为我们会消灭柯罗诺斯。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_272.bf.json:10:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_272.bf.json:10:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}你们拥有打倒阴影的力量，\n进而能让我找回记忆……\n因此，你们被召唤到了这里。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_272.bf.json:10:3",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}但真的只是这样吗……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_272.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0082",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 B7 0D}你们有“心意”。\n也可以称为意志或志向。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_272.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 0F 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}无论卷入怎样的命运，\n你们都会用双脚踏稳大地，\n冲破风暴继续前进吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_272.bf.json:12:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}命运只会对这样的人\n报以微笑……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_272.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0092",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 A4 0D}{F1 82}……\n我没有担心什么。\n因为有你，有大家在。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_272.bf.json:13:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_0092",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 80 0D}谢谢……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_272.bf.json:14:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞善露出了淡淡的微笑……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_272.bf.json:15:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞再次坚定决心，\n　向着顶峰出发……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 }
